From 7b0a8b2853fc5073f7dc87b585e779ff771cafb3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:32:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] config: select AWS-LC C11 without a conflicting toolchain
 default

MSVC toolchains add /std:c17 before AWS-LC explicitly selects /std:c11,
producing D9025 once per C compilation. Register a build-overlay patch
excluding only the default C standard feature for explicit C11 targets.
Retain the other target features, C++ options, and warning flags.

Focused real MSVC action analysis fails for crypto and ssl on the base
with both standards, then passes after the configuration correction.
An independent control retains the toolchain C17 default. Native Windows
compilation remains an acceptance gate.
---
 MODULE.bazel                            |   6 ++
 patches/BUILD.bazel                     |   1 +
 patches/aws_lc_c_standard.patch         | 100 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tools/aws-lc-standard/BUILD.bazel       |  91 +++++++++++++++++++++
 tools/aws-lc-standard/default.c         |   1 +
 tools/aws-lc-standard/standard_test.bzl |  41 ++++++++++
 6 files changed, 240 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 patches/aws_lc_c_standard.patch
 create mode 100644 tools/aws-lc-standard/BUILD.bazel
 create mode 100644 tools/aws-lc-standard/default.c
 create mode 100644 tools/aws-lc-standard/standard_test.bzl

